{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5caae5923a7818884d19476d5729de858e3346751ec21a27571f0ea1faf33ca3", "ja": "（星梨花のPV撮影が、無事終わった。\nスタッフさん達の間でも、評判は上々だ！）", "zh": "（星梨花顺利拍完PV了。\n工作人员们也对她大为赞赏！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "b3527c40a7c68305a5628ecff0458cd3192ad8f39052d80afdeea8c7e9e53460", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nわたしの演技、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我的演技如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cd1d1dd6d9356f262d86c7726dd8393d2147c1dd0e0ebc4fec4c1f5a8ae516a4", "ja": "お疲れさま、よかったよ。\nいいPVになると思う！", "zh": "辛苦了，你演得很棒喔。\n应该会是支不错的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "754b08bd93e18b1c44663cf39ec48bb3e58a5285ac7323214e622b678c83a1f7", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\nわたしも、撮影していて、すごく楽しかったです♪", "zh": "哇～谢谢夸奖！\n我在拍摄时也很开心喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ebd5c074093031b5070b5bca1abf6b450fd4ace067774ba121c155d9102d3bb", "ja": "星梨花、本当に楽しそうだったな。\nクラシック音楽がテーマなのが、よかったのかな？", "zh": "星梨花，你看起来真的很开心呢。\n因为主题是古典乐，你才这么乐在其中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "47a2f2cd2c8462a476e1cddfff2dffad276ac6c6310322503fe20e4305f9bcc8", "ja": "えへへ……それって、なんだか不思議ですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿……我觉得很神奇呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d464b2f45d9d8f4da87b15d3eba5324a00d2985bbeb24705041f4e0bb9211bb7", "ja": "不思議？　今回のテーマが、か？", "zh": "神奇？你说这次的主题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "bdfaa735b38c56911dceb7f4fa1954aa21b8477dd8ee974e18bf9acf24aa05da", "ja": "はい！　わたし、ヴァイオリンは好きですけど、\nパパとママに言われて習ってたものだから……。", "zh": "是的！我虽然很喜欢小提琴，\n但那是爸爸和妈妈要我学的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fb47682f365b7073c26316896fe20dbe36450fa2a26df6109260fb00f7a00ff", "ja": "でもアイドルは、わたしが絶対やりたかったことで。\nそのふたつが一緒になるのって、なんだかすごいです！", "zh": "不过偶像是我自己坚持要来当的。\n这两样东西居然碰在一块，感觉好巧喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58d5b88f3c267891dec6bc7d78c5658d178faa87286976f65003663d979c449d", "ja": "なるほど……言われてみれば、確かにすごい事かもな。\n星梨花は、アイドルになる運命だったのかもしれない。", "zh": "原来如此……经你这么一说，的确是很巧。\n星梨花，或许你的命运就是注定要成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "d11140196b1ac25691f1e088f0a78ddcf3f200f4c254bc35a079f8f4a69b5aaf", "ja": "運命……あっ、わかりました！\nベートーヴェンですね！", "zh": "命运……啊，我想到了！\n是贝多芬的曲子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "485069eeccc5c47c9096b2b8781d0f24649a5e33b4448925dab931c9bf830ef0", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不是，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "277bf3a26ae17b0f1615857a238de11ee0b32f5d4dfc5063f1670ebf229eb054", "ja": "でもそれなら、{$P$}さんと\nわたしが出会ったのも、運命なんでしょうか？", "zh": "不过，这样说的话，{$P$}先生，\n你和我相遇也是命运吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b72b6ab25b0e6131da7f6bd019e9bfa2b7e27479caa5518f3f75d4f994a3b8e9", "ja": "はは……そこまではどうだろうな？\nでも、そうだったらいいな。", "zh": "哈哈……这我就不敢说了。\n不过，我希望是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "df12b679ae3a6bb3817b0c80bcedecc3de8e681780f35bb10b62cf09aa76d90f", "ja": "はい！　そうだったら、とっても素敵です♪", "zh": "我也是！如果是命运，那就太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1482323dc7765245c5b7d933adee1a616083b433d96c6f05006e582bb68a945", "ja": "{$P$}さん。これからもわたしに、\nいろいろなことを教えてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今后也要请你继续\n指导我许多事情喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0054_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "3ada30a5aee9a6be57145ba3498790cd8e4579c59f18efd7db63654c393b263c", "ja": "それが、{$P$}さんの運命です！\nじゃじゃじゃじゃーん！　……なんて、えへへっ♪", "zh": "这就是{$P$}先生的命运！\n锵锵锵锵～！开玩笑的，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
